An app is an application.
An application has a package name.

A device has a name and installed applications.

A device.
The device has a name "this device".

A function "__ext_open_application".

To open an application.
    /*FIXME:Call the function "__ext_open_application" with the package name of the application.*/
    Ask the device to open the application with the package name of the application.
End.

